# NOTE: The Git LFS rules for the prebuilt binaries live in
# litert/prebuilt/.gitattributes. Do not add `filter=lfs` rules to this root
# file: Swift Package Manager 6.4+ only checks the root .gitattributes, and if
# it finds `filter=lfs` there it requires git-lfs and runs `git lfs pull` after
# every package checkout. That pull resolves LFS objects against SwiftPM's local
# mirror of this repository, which only has the default branch's LFS objects,
# so it can fail for other branches and tags. See also .lfsconfig.
